===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|schize|schīze|lang=gmh}}, originally *{{term||schīte}}, from {{proto|Germanic|skeit-a-|lang=de}} from {{proto|Indo-European|skei-d-|to part|lang=de}}.  Indo-European cognates include Ancient Greek {{term|σχιστός|tr=skhistos|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

